event: response.output_text.done
data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_09fac754d01d8e90006af881df5ddc87d2b1f5db0372697c06","logprobs":[],"output_index":0,"sequence_number":99,"text":"Let's consider the geographical locations of the three cities:\n\n- Paris is in France, which is in Europe and definitely in the northern hemisphere.\n- Tokyo is in Japan, which is also in the northern hemisphere.\n- Lima is the capital city of Peru, which is in South America and lies south of the Equator—placing it in the southern hemisphere.\n\nTherefore, only Lima is in the southern hemisphere. Now, I will check the current weather for Lima (unit: Celsius)."}

